TEXT -2552 -104 Left 2 ;Notes: \n- Set offset and amplitude of the AC source to produce a sinusoidal\n  voltage (Note: Magnitude varies between 12.6-15.4Vrms)\n- Rload is the variable resistor in your load which changes \n  from appx. 5-105 ohms.
TEXT -2256 -488 Right 2 ;Load \n(2.5VA-7.5VA)
TEXT -2112 -168 Right 2 ;Current Sens
TEXT -2000 -616 Left 2 ;Voltage Sens
TEXT -2552 -848 Left 3 ;Part1\nVoltage and Current sensing circuit design
TEXT -2536 216 Left 3 ;Part2\nLevel-shifting and amplification circuit design
TEXT -1336 -864 Left 3 ;Part3\nFilter circuit designs
TEXT -1320 -104 Left 3 ;Part4\n5V regulator circuit design
TEXT -312 -848 Left 3 ;Part5\n2V1 Offset Voltage
